# A second panel's own config, and Kilo's local plans/state: this machine only, never source.
config.7330.json
.kilo/

# The docs mirror the board used to keep: /docs/ and /reviews/ are served from docs/ and
# docs/reviews/ themselves (lib/http/static.js), so nothing copies them any more. Both folders stay
# ignored, so a hand copy cannot come back as untracked source.
public/docs/
public/reviews/

# A reader-only page: local by design, never committed - any directory, every clone.
#
# A .secret.html is the report a clarify card links: the evidence, the guidance and the drafted text
# behind one decision, written for the reader's eyes and not for the history. The suffix is the whole
# rule, so a page can sit beside its evidence and still be local; tools/reports-tracked.mjs exempts
# the same suffix, because a page that is ignored on purpose is not a page a worktree lost.
*.secret.html
